    <string name="howto_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="howto_body">NoDPI runs an HTTP(S) proxy server on your device. Traffic sent through it is unblocked: the ClientHello of blocked domains is fragmented around SNI and sent with disorder.\n\n1. Start the proxy.\n2. Open Wi-Fi settings, edit your network, set Proxy to Manual and enter the host and port shown above.\n3. Alternatively, set the proxy only in an app or browser that supports HTTP proxies.\n\nThe proxy does not change your IP address and does not encrypt traffic.</string>
